  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://wiki.swequestrian.com/uploads/images/gallery/2026-01/scaled-1680-/banner-vulcans-flashlights.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<br><span style=\"color:#f90\"><strong>在可预见的未来，开发工作已暂停。<br>SWE/M 团队目前无法投入时间修复、移植和升级此模组。<br>对于由此造成的不便，我们深表歉意。我们将重返该项目，只是具体时间尚未确定。</strong></span><br><br><br></p>\n<h4><strong>新增内容 - <em><span style=\"color:#930;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">包含哪些内容？</span></em></strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li>手电筒</li>\n<li>超能手电筒</li>\n<li>矿工头盔</li>\n<li>超能矿工头盔</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>合成配方 - <span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#930\"><em>如何制作它们！</em></span></strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">---&gt;</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">手电筒：</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://wiki.swequestrian.com/uploads/images/gallery/2026-01/scaled-1680-/jV7image.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">---&gt;</span>&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>超能手电筒：</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://wiki.swequestrian.com/uploads/images/gallery/2026-01/scaled-1680-/1CQimage.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">---&gt;</span>&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>矿工头盔：</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/928956/description_a9706ec4-a716-4c92-8024-ad556ba207ea.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>---&gt;</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>超能矿工头盔：</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://wiki.swequestrian.com/uploads/images/gallery/2026-01/scaled-1680-/ZLFimage.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px;color:#f00\"><strong>如何为它们充电？</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><em>通过<span style=\"color:#f00\">红石粉</span>修复手电筒。通过<span style=\"color:#f00\">红石块</span>修复超能手电筒。无需使用铁砧。</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>功能介绍 - <span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em><span style=\"color:#930\">它们有什么作用？</span></em></span></strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li>在黑暗的地洞和海洋中，手电筒和头盔可以指引你的方向，无需不断放置火把或发光石膏。</li>\n<li>电量低时会闪烁。</li>\n<li>物品/实体可能导致闪烁并/或加速电池消耗。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>配置选项 - <span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#930\"><em>如何更改某些方面？</em></span></strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>我们的许多功能都是可选的，你可以通过配置文件定制模组！（如果对此不确定，建议在 YouTube 上搜索“如何更改模组配置”以获取帮助！）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>闪烁功能的开关</li>\n<li>闪烁视觉效果开关（适用于感官敏感用户）</li>\n<li>方块/实体列表 + 闪烁倍数</li>\n<li>方块/实体列表 + 消耗倍数</li>\n<li>闪烁范围（方块/实体开始触发闪烁效果的半径）</li>\n<li>消耗范围（方块/实体开始触发电量消耗效果的半径）</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p><strong>----------------------------------------------------------------</strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>致谢：</em></strong><br><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;制作负责人&nbsp; &nbsp;||&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>AlaharranHonor<br><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1.20 开发者&nbsp; ||&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>Quarris<strong><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;着色器&nbsp; ||&nbsp; </strong>AlexModGuy (参考 Alex's Caves, LGPL)<br><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;资源与贴图&nbsp; &nbsp;||&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>AlaharranHonor<br><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;委托方&nbsp; &nbsp;||&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>Vulcan</p>\n<p><em><strong>权利、整合包和视频：</strong></em></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><strong>权利&nbsp; ||&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>LGPL 3.0<br><strong>整合包&nbsp; &nbsp;||&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>无需署名，但请联系我们以便我们也去游玩！<br><strong>视频&nbsp; &nbsp;||&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>请告知我们，以便我们分享给朋友们！</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
